# Example ReRDMFT input file: H2 at its experimental equilibrium bond length
# (r_e = 0.7414 Angstrom), minimal STO-3G basis, C4_DHF only. Validates
# SCF_DIRECT_4C TRUE (the DHF SCF iterations build their Fock matrices fully
# integral-direct, UKB/UkbFockMatrixDirect.h's ukbFockTwoElectronDirect, never
# holding a two-electron tensor during the SCF) against the ordinary dense
# C4_DHF path on the same geometry/basis -- the converged energy must match.
NELEC 2
BASIS water-sto-3g.gbs
C4_SPINOR TRUE
SCF_DIRECT_4C TRUE

GEOMETRY
H   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   0.741400
END
